message.content:
{"diagnosis": "Fetch made no progress with max_addr=0x00000000 vs expected advancing PC through 256-word NOP mem, yielding TRAP: no progress and FAIL 0xdead over 2009 cycles. Root cause in picorv32.v:583-587 where mem_state 0 on mem_do_prefetch||mem_do_rinst||mem_do_rdata sets mem_valid but holds mem_state <= 0 instead of advancing to wait-for-ready, so the transaction never completes.",
"patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -583,7 +583,7 @@
 					if (mem_do_prefetch || mem_do_rinst || mem_do_rdata) begin
 						mem_valid <= !mem_la_use_prefetched_high_word;
 						mem_instr <= mem_do_prefetch || mem_do_rinst;
 						mem_wstrb <= 0;
-						mem_state <= 0;
+						mem_state <= 1;
",
"expected": "tohost PASS (no FAIL 0xdead), no TRAP: no progress, max_addr progresses beyond 0x00000000"}

